/target
.DS_Store

# Dependency trees and build output, at the ROOT so they apply on every branch.
#
# These lived in `ts/.gitignore`, and `ts/` exists only on the TypeScript verifier's branch. Switching
# away from that branch left its `node_modules` in the working tree as untracked files, no ignore rule
# covered them here, and `git add -A` committed 783 vendored files and 30 generated ones onto this
# branch — from where they reached every branch above it. A branch-local ignore rule cannot cover an
# artefact that appears on other branches (S9-E11-08).
node_modules/
ts/dist/
